     "title": "一句“老登”撕开假象：品牌伪年轻化，总在冒犯付费主力",
     "link": "https://www.huxiu.com/article/4900209.html?f=rss",
     "pubDate": "Sun, 25 Oct 2026 01:15:10 +0800",
